OL,3,GNEWSADozens of firefighters continue to
OL,4,Atackle house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews remain at the scene of a
OL,7,Fhouse fire in Birmingham.
OL,9,FWest Midlands Fire Service (WMFS) said
OL,10,F10 fire engines had attended the blaze
OL,11,Fat Drayton Road in Kings Heath on
OL,12,FSaturday night.
OL,14,FIn an update issued to the BBC, the
OL,15,Fservice said two fire engines were
OL,16,Fstill in the area after they were
OL,17,Finitially called at 21:40 BST.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
