OL,3,GNEWSADozens of firefighters continue to
OL,4,Atackle house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe WMFS spokesperson confirmed some
OL,7,Fnearby residents had been evacuated,
OL,8,Fbut they were unable to confirm the
OL,9,Fcause of the fire or if anyone had been
OL,10,Finjured.
